rtime</code></td><td>GUID</td><td>Unique ID of overtime<br/><br/>ex. <code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">1c2463d7-43ec-4b83-a29c-d66087d8e8df</code></td></tr><tr><td><code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">number</code></td><td><code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">overtime</code></td><td>Integer</td><td>Overtime number</td></tr><tr><td><code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">sequence</code></td><td><code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">overtime</code></td><td>Integer</td><td>Period sequence number (The first overtime sequence would be <code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">5</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">quarter</code></td><td><code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">game</code></td><td>Integer</td><td>Quarter number of the game</td></tr><tr><td><code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">id</code></td><td><code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">quarter</code></td><td>GUID</td><td>Unique ID of a quarter<br/><br/>ex. <code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">47091cc4-08c2-4f83-9d8d-59c3c85e1725</code></td></tr><tr><td><code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">number</code></td><td><code class="rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined" data-lang="">quarter</code></td><td>Integer</td><td>Quarter number</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></details></div>
