e85c6ca237f5f","term":"RESTful","definition":"An architectural style for an application programming interface (API) that uses HTTP requests to access and use data."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f60","term":"General Sport API","definition":"The General Sport APIs provide a breadth of coverage across numerous leagues worldwide. All General Sport APIs follow a consistent structure and format between sports, making it easy to consume the data across different leagues or competitions."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f61","term":"GraphQL","definition":"Click [here](https://graphql.org/learn/) to learn more about GraphQL!"},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f62","term":"Rolling Quota","definition":"Our rolling 30-day schedule means calls from 31 days prior are removed from your quota each day.\n\nFor example, a rolling 30-day period at the end of a month could include requests from the 1st to the 30th. The following day would take requests made from the 2nd to the 31st."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f63","term":"Elam Ending","definition":"The game clock is turned off for the final \"Elam\" period. A target score is established based on the leading team’s current score plus a fixed value. The first team to reach the target score on a made basket wins."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f64","term":"Quad 1","definition":"Home games vs. RPI teams ranked in the top 30; neutral games vs. 1-50; away games vs. 1-75."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f65","term":"Quad 2","definition":"Home vs. 31-75 teams; neutral vs. 51-100; away vs. 76-135."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f66","term":"Quad 3","definition":"Home vs. 76-160 teams; neutral vs. 101-200; away vs. 136-240."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f67","term":"Quad 4","definition":"Home vs. 161-plus teams; neutral vs. 201-plus; away vs. 241-plus."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f68","term":"RESTful","definition":"An architectural style for an application programming interface (API) that uses HTTP requests to access and use data."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f69","term":"General Sport API","definition":"The General Sport APIs provide a breadth of coverage across numerous leagues worldwide. All General Sport APIs follow a consistent structure and format between sports, making it easy to consume the data across different leagues or competitions."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f6a","term":"GraphQL","definition":"Click [here](https://graphql.org/learn/) to learn more about GraphQL!"},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f6b","term":"Rolling Quota","definition":"Our rolling 30-day schedule means calls from 31 days prior are removed from your quota each day.\n\nFor example, a rolling 30-day period at the end of a month could include requests from the 1st to the 30th. The following day would take requests made from the 2nd to the 31st."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f6c","term":"marquee","definition":"A big, spotlighted event that is meant to draw attention and generate excitement."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f6d","term":"Quad 1","definition":"Home games vs. RPI teams ranked in the top 30; neutral games vs. 1-50; away games vs. 1-75."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f6e","term":"Quad 2","definition":"Home vs. 31-75 teams; neutral vs. 51-100; away vs. 76-135."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f6f","term":"Quad 3","definition":"Home vs. 76-160 teams; neutral vs. 101-200; away vs. 136-240."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f70","term":"Quad 4","definition":"Home vs. 161-plus teams; neutral vs. 201-plus; away vs. 241-plus."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f71","term":"RESTful","definition":"An architectural style for an application programming interface (API) that uses HTTP requests to access and use data."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f72","term":"General Sport API","definition":"The General Sport APIs provide a breadth of coverage across numerous leagues worldwide. All General Sport APIs follow a consistent structure and format between sports, making it easy to consume the data across different leagues or competitions."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f73","term":"GraphQL","definition":"Click [here](https://graphql.org/learn/) to learn more about GraphQL!"},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f74","term":"Rolling Quota","definition":"Our rolling 30-day schedule means calls from 31 days prior are removed from your quota each day.\n\nFor example, a rolling 30-day period at the end of a month could include requests from the 1st to the 30th. The following day would take requests made from the 2nd to the 31st."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f75","term":"GUID","definition":"Global Unique Identifier"}],"variables":{"user":{},"defaults":[{"name":"x-api-key","source":"security","type":"apiKey","_id":"692496faad25b92dd30fbffd"}]},"navigation":[],"project":{"flags":{"agentMetrics":false,"agentSkills":false,"aiDocsAudit":false,"aiPageLinting":true,"aiTranslation":false,"aiWriter":false,"allowApiExplorerJsonEditor":false,"allowBlockedDomainLaunch":false,"allowLaunchWithoutCard":false,"allowReusableOTPs":false,"allowUnsafeCustomHtmlSuggestionsFromNonAdmins":false,"allowXFrame":true,"alwaysShowDocPublishStatus":false,"apiAccessRevoked":false,"askAiOverride":"","bidiSync":true,"bidiSyncBitbucketSelfServe":false,"bidiSyncSkipIndexedHistory":true,"bidiSyncUseGitCli":false,"bidiSyncUseOdbAlternates":true,"bitbucketCloudSync":false,"bitbucketDirectEvents":false,"changelogRssAlwaysPublic":false,"changelogsInGitto":true,"childManagedBidi":true,"collaborativeReview":false,"correctnewlines":false,"customDomainAdminBypass":false,"directGoogleToStableVersion":false,"disableAiChat":false,"disableAiInlineEditor":false,"disableAiWriter":false,"disableAnonForum":false,"disableAskAiApi":false,"disableAutoTranslate":false,"disableDiscussionSpamRecaptchaBypass":false,"disableDocsAudit":false,"disablePageLinter":false,"disablePasswordlessLogin":false,"disableSignups":false,"disableSuperframe":false,"dynamicLlmsTxt":false,"enableOidc":false,"enterprise":true,"enterpriseAiWriter":false,"externalSdkSnippets":false,"gittoUseConnectionPooling":false,"gittoUseExperimentalMDXCache":false,"gitTranslations":false,"googleAuthEnabled":false,"graphql":false,"hideAiFeatures":false,"hideEnforceSSO":false,"hubGoBridge":false,"inlineComments":false,"inlineLintingViolations":false,"jwtReplacePermissions":false,"mcpOauth":false,"mcpSendFeedback":false,"mdx":false,"mdxish":true,"mdxishEditor":true,"mdxSanitizeComments":false,"newEditorDash":true,"newExplorerReducer":false,"newIframeStructure":false,"oauth":false,"passwordlessLogin":"default","prefetch":false,"rdmdCompatibilityMode":false,"requiresJQuery":true,"reviewWorkflow":true,"singleProjectEnterprise":false,"staging":false,"star":false,"streamingSsr":false,"superHub":true,"superHubBranchReviewSummaries":false,"superHubMigrationSelfServeFlow":false,"superHubMsTeamsAppPackage":false,"superHubMsTeamsNotifications":false,"superHubMultiGuides":false,"superHubPlanManagement":true,"superHubPreview":false,"superHubSlack":false,"superHubSlackNotifications":false,"superHubUiTesting":false,"tokenBasedBilling":false,"translation":false,"useDeprecatedSafelistMethod":false,"dashReact":true,"superHubBranchReviewActions":false},"versions":[{"__v":1,"_id":"652e8a2bf730f71979a627e7","createdAt":"2023-10-17T13:20:43.479Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-05T18:28:28.210Z","project":"63517a19c854d800a4cfec52","version":"1","version_clean":"1.0.0","codename":"Global Basketball v1","is_stable":false,"is_beta":false,"is_hidden":false,"is_deprecated":false,"forked_from":"63517a18c854d800a4cfe75f","categories":[],"releaseDate":"2022-08-03T16:41:07.456Z","pdfStatus":"","apiRegistries":[{"filename":"nba.json","uuid":"1pra10lak0j489"},{"filename":"draft.json","uuid":"2cet1il7i1sift"},{"filename":"wnba.json","uuid":"1rzxygmvlal9crdf"},{"filename":"nba-g-league.json","uuid":"1iukbk2ublal8f0pp"},{"filename":"ncaa-mens-basketball.json","uuid":"s1qcrvy2pilalanujr"},{"filename":"ncaa-womens-basketball.json","uuid":"1rzxygm2vlal9woq2"},{"filename":"global-basketball.json","uuid":"1iukbkulaliprr2"}